  ('role-swap-en', 'en', 'Funny', 'Role Reversal', 'The wrong character has the right job.', 'cat as the boss|dog as the teacher|panda as the chef|turtle delivers mail|parrot tour guide|monkey barber|hippo dentist|fox referee|elephant taxi driver|penguin lifeguard|octopus drummer|crab bus driver|giraffe gardener|kangaroo boxer|otter photographer|rabbit police|hedgehog postman|frog news anchor|whale ship captain|seal soccer player|dinosaur babysitter|robot as a pet|kid teaches parent|student tests prof|dad steals snacks|mom in baby stroller|boss serves tea|chef eats noodles|doctor fears needles|firefighter squirts|lost police officer|lost tour guide|painter cannot draw|magician without hat|referee gets a card|athlete cheers on|camera man on film|host steals the mic|parcel for courier|guard lost his keys|teacher falls asleep|student at the desk|dog walks owner|cat grooms owner|hamster trains human|crow teaches parrot|alien sells earth|moon shades the sun|cloud wets umbrella|robot teaches dance', 18),
